  class: evidence_proposed
  shape: rectangle
  tooltip: "ID: context_broker\nResponsibility: Return bounded project-specific evidence and lessons to a review or agent run.\nOwner: Tabellio maintainers\nRuntime: Read-only Node.js API or MCP tool\nState variables: request_scope; head_sha; packet_digest; access_decision\nInvariants: Context is scoped to the requester, project, repository, and exact head.\nEvidence: intended/design_document: docs/agent-provenance-ledger-and-codex-feedback.md:1#Agent Provenance Ledger and Codex Feedback Plan @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca; intended/design_document: docs/architecture-diagrams.md:1#Tabellio System Architecture Diagrams @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca"
}

